<title>USA: CompUSA Q4 same-store sales rise 9.7 pct.</title>
<headline>CompUSA Q4 same-store sales rise 9.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	   $1,150	 $999     +23.0	 +9.7</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $4,610     $3,800     +22.0	 +5.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Quarter is   14 weeks ended		June 28.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			   CompUSA Inc.</p>
<p>Note: CompUSA operates 129 stores.</p>
</text>
